can reach their dreams.

534
00:43:15,506 --> 00:43:16,949
Just like you did for me.

535
00:43:18,870 --> 00:43:21,921
And if you don't go,
will you regret it?

536
00:43:22,993 --> 00:43:25,405
One day, you might
find yourself wondering

537
00:43:25,430 --> 00:43:27,024
