538
00:43:29,285 --> 00:43:32,098
And... what about us?

539
00:43:33,322 --> 00:43:36,223
What about us?
It'll stay the same.

540
00:43:36,508 --> 00:43:37,961
We'll just be farther apart.

541
00:43:39,068 --> 00:43:40,957
And we don't have
to rush anything.

542
00:43:48,710 --> 00:43:52,571
Being apart doesn't mean
we have to let go of each other.

543
00:43:55,310 --> 00:43:57,341
The distance may grow.

544
00:43:58,214 --> 00:44:00,928
