548
00:44:18,376 --> 00:44:20,301
Neither of us
has to wait for the other.

549
00:44:21,484 --> 00:44:23,772
We'll just wait
for the right time.

550
00:44:24,058 --> 00:44:25,526
Then we'll find each other again.

551
00:44:33,502 --> 00:44:35,705
Everyone has their own dreams.

552
00:44:36,738 --> 00:44:38,635
I think it's time

553
00:44:38,660 --> 00:44:40,778
